he  final aspects that make split gate split  gate are those thrusters on our back not  quite enough power to send us to the  moon and back but more than enough to  get a little verticality into our game  you'll be looking up and down an awful  lot in split gate boots on the ground is  not the only way to play here oh and i  should mention that momentum plays a big  part in split gate if you go into one  portal damn fast he'll come out the  other one just as quick so enjoy the  hang time  right stop a second i have to put this  in because someone you know will  inevitably do this in game if there's a  player you can't quite catch up but they  turn a corner just as you turn a corner  you should know it's likely that you're  chasing yourself and yes mythbusters  alert it's indeed possible to shoot  yourself in the back of the head do with  this information what you will but  committing to doku doesn't help your  teammates  although it's a little bit funny  split gate has a butt ton of game modes  here are a few of them which i quite  like let's skip the usual team death  match in domination mode you already  know those what about these ones  takedown takedown is a three on three  squad match in which you have to  eliminate the entire opposition team at  the same time sounds hard well each time  they die their respawn timer extends  ultimately staying alive for 20 seconds  against a crack team of operatives is  harder than you think  showdown showdown is similar to takedown  but no respawning at all a single life  you and your squad take on the other  until one team wins six times this game  mode is great for learning how to stay  alive and to navigate portals to keep  your distance of course it's a complete  nightmare with randoms but that's fun  too right team oddball is like capture  the flag as long as one of your  teammates holds that shiny macguffin  disco ball you'll rack up points quickly  it can also be used as a weapon which  one taps the enemy which is surprisingly  fun gun game is here too and it allows  you to get your hands on all weapons in  split gate and asks you a simple  question can you murder someone with  each of these weapons rocket launchers  shotguns pistols a riot bat and the last  elim is fists only play this game mode  to quickly get to grips with all the  weapons you'll have much more time to  use in other modes this game mode is all  about mayhem all 22 tiers of it team  shotty snipers is another great mode  which is essentially team deathmatch but  only with sniper rifles and shotguns  long range and short range only great  for practicing your strats and finding  cheeky portal camping points all while  checking you can still be aware of those  fools who try to bum rush you team swat  is a great mode that rewards head shots  it's a one bullet elimination regardless  of the weapon if you hit them in the  brain box you can take a bunch of shots  to the torso before going down but a  single bullet to the dome wins this  fight if you're looking to improve your  aim and first shot accuracy play this  mode teams what on top of that there are  a bunch of limited time modes which come  and go into the game every so often  right now i'm playing instagib and i  love this mode it's a free-for-all where  every bullet is a one shot kill  basically hitting someone in the toe is  just like a head shot  every one of us has an instacharge  railgun with limitless bullets you'll  die a bunch of times but those moments  where you rack up six kills in a row are  immense  one in the chamber is another great mode  again it's a one bullet kill but if you  miss that bullet you have no bullets  left you must use your fists instead if  you successfully shoot someone and take  their life you get another bullet in  your weapon rinse and repeat simple idea  but it works really well and finally a  game mode i cannot support  teabag confirm yes i'm sure you've  already figured out what that means to  confirm your kill you must debug the  player you just offed to some that'll be  great to others that is a hate crime in  itself and to make this worse split gate  tracks how many times you've teabagged a  player how much of a good boy are you  that's a handful of game modes to try  out right now in split gate and they've  promised lots more are coming in the  future and those who want to get sweaty  there is a competitive playlist for both  three and four squad games  so how the hell do the split gate team  make money if their game is free i bet  you've already guessed it cosmetic items  just like the trend is these days  splitgate uses a battle pass and a  storefront to get your cash and from  what i've seen there's an okay selection  to choose from in the store too it  definitely is early days though here as  it's the first person shooter the real  customization we all want is a weapon  wrap and that's when something good  happens not only can cosmetics be bought  in the store and via the battle pass  they can be earned in-game through  eliminations and other challenges golden  weapon wraps will be yours one day there  are tons to unlock all completely for  free they may not be as fancy as the  paid stuff but it's still possible to  look your way without breaking the bank  and there's also a steady stream of free  loot boxes to help entice you just  promise you won't get addicted oh and  you can even change the color of your  portals if you wanted to i like that  touch the future of split gate is in the  balance right now a seemingly great idea  almost died a couple of years ago when  it first released at the pc community  but a dev team of four people kept  working at it to evolve and update the  game into what we see today soon  splitgate will leave open beta and we'll  know exactly what direction it wants to  take us with a replay function coming  nextgen upgrades to ps5 and xbox series  x and a switch version is coming too  split gate certainly has potential but  it will need support to keep going i  have to admit i really like split gate  and it have about 40 tips to improve  your gameplay if anyone would be  interested in that i would really like  to add split gate to our regular covered  games here but of course that choice is  yours not mine watching this video helps  a like helps even more a comment too  shall we do this if you're still here  please write the cake is a lie in the  comments and for the first few hours  today i'll try and send a reply to  everyone who does thank you very much  for your time i'm adam you're awesome  i'll see you in split gate i'll be the  guy chasing himself through portals  [Music]  you
 

